(211,251,134,0,'2022-11-09','completed','It was good, because I got chance to work with new technology which I never ever use in my career before joining, In the past time It was very interesting moment to work in Live Project under guidance of My Appraiser. ','Join as a Trainee and After few weeks got opportunity to work in Live project with the support of my appraiser, this can be treat as My Achievement,\r\n','I like most here the support and guidance of My Seniors, Specially the moto of my seniors that they generate thought in us like to do yourself, try yourself, then you will able to resolve issue, and after that if you will stuck somewhere then I am here to pull you up.','Tea quality should be improve .\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,'I would like to suggest you to work upon your communication skills',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(212,250,81,0,'2022-11-01','completed','This year I have learned many new boards, sensors, and their working, and also worked on different and interesting tasks. I have experienced a good professional culture which helps me in building my professional personality. So that is why this year is good for me.\r\n','I successfully connected the boards like 9160DK and thingy91 to the azure cloud, Sends the custom data(by discovering the functions and files for sending the data), and all other sensor data to the cloud.\r\n\r\nModify the code to encode and decode the data from the board to the cloud \r\n\r\n\r\nResolves the problem of azure not being able to store data in DB as data stores in telemetry not in the twin change event \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI have merges the codes created by Gulzar ji along with the project that Mohit was working on into my project\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAdded all 28 data fields in the BMS project that is provided by the Andrew \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDecoded the code to get the value of the complete packet(from 90-98) that is sent by the BMS\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSelected a Bluetooth sample project, Resolved the problem, and worked on sending the Data through the Bluetooth \r\n\r\nCreated a successful connection between the peripheral and central board and sent the UART data over Bluetooth.\r\n\r\nSend a large amount of data over Bluetooth and resolve all problems regarding buffer overflow, Limitations of Bluetooth, and Advertising issues.\r\n\r\nSend the whole BMS packet along with the hardcoded other sensors data over Bluetooth as well as create a connection between the Peripheral and the app and sends all the BMS and sensor data along with the dynamic MAC address.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWork on making builds for all the boards like nrf9160DK, Thingy91, nrf5340DK, and Thingy53 and make them all work as peripheral devices that can be used to send the BMS data.\r\n\r\n','Friendly environment, management is very cooperative and easily reachable, The higher authorities can be easily approachable to deliver our words. \r\nWe work directly with the client, so we get direct feedback from it.\r\n\r\nThe rules are not conveyed in the company in a regulatory manner.\r\nThe rules and regulations in the company are not told before, it is suddenly modified as per the situation. \r\n','The washroom should be fragrant, it should not smell bad. There should be proper maintenance for that.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(213,252,81,0,'2022-12-01','completed','For this year I have worked with different programming language , worked on different api and different setup like linux and windows, running linux script in windows and accessing server using ftp protocol, so I can say this past year was fairly great for me.','I successfully worked on  \n\n1. how to read imei number using AT command and created board certificate for the board  and worked on powershell and python script \n\n2. worked on node(express) while using sql command for database for gfood and successfully worked on its backend \n\n3. successfully created three script for scarping reviews  about companies ,\n\n4. also successfully worked on different api for getting user details from facebook ,instagram , twitter and many other api\'s\n\n5. successfully worked on truecaller script for getting name from phone number and address while using python gui to display it , \n\n6. rooted android phone and also learned how to install device firmware in case your brick \n\n7. worked on how to bypass gmail id lock \n\nAt the end  I worked on different programming and script language like python , node , powershell, expressjs while using windows as well as linux  development environment  so the most import achievement is to resolve many issue while working on project which are different every  month and are very interesting and fun. ','I like the office culture, the way senior and junior interact and help each other , friendly environment and  last but  not the least higher authority is cooperative and easy accessible.\r\n\r\nThe thing which I dislike is that there should be benefit for working on new project or doing multiple at the same time. ','No issue',NULL,NULL,NULL,'you need to work upon your interpersonal skills  and communication skills',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(214,256,134,0,'2023-01-01','completed','It was satisfactory because I didn\'t get opportunity to work with client but I got chance to work in live project. ','My achievement is to design Gfood Admin Panel, API integration, Successfully implementation of River-pod state management ','Like - Guidance of seniors, Friday Party, Salary on Time\r\n','NA',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(215,262,81,0,'2023-03-01','completed','Past six training months has been good for me, From joining as a Fresher, to learn and work on a Live Project in Flutter, I got opportunity to learn, got help from senior team members whenever needed and gave contribution in a Project, It has been a good journey till now. ','Being team member of the CellCheck project in my training period is itself an achievement, But if I have to shortlist most important achievements then they will be:\r\nmy work on the bluetooth Section of the app in its early stage and \r\nwork on the graph Section to show Device data.\r\n   ','I like the work environment and culture of this organization, All the team members have been very helpful, supporting and friendly. I would like to add one thing that all the company policies must be clear to a new trainee/employee before/after joining, that will be great. ','Not at all.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'He seems dedicated and sincere towards his work and always completes his tasks within the given deadline. ',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(216,221,81,205,'2023-03-01','completed','It was good, i have been working on client project and learning new technologies.','My most important achievement is that, i have handled both frontend and backend of my current project successfully with the help of my team leader','I liked the way company cooperate with me to work in hybrid environment. To achieve both professional and family responsibilities successfully.\r\nI really dislike most the chairs, most of them are really not comfortable to sit all day long.','Company should provide trainings to their employees. Such as technical, communicational and work place behaviour. It will really boost the overall performance of company instead of a single individual.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'She seems to be dedicated and hardworking towards her work and completes the given task within the deadline.',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(217,134,83,206,'2023-03-01','completed','i faced some challenges during handling the two clients concurrently . and i have taken it positively. This was good for me and organization as well . \r\n','i have now exposure in some new technologies like Flutter , NodeJs , etc which is the achievement for me . And also It is very proudly feeling that i am continuously working on live projects for many years . \r\n','I like everything about organization except leave rules. \r\n','No Issue',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
