(220,81,83,207,'2023-05-01','completed','Past year was good, get opportunity to hire and trained new Trainees in flutter and nodejs, worked in different Azure services, give best performance to client, attend meeting with client without any issues and completed Cellcheck Demo project successfully with team.','I achieved number of small and big target during last year but to complete Cellcheck project Demo version was best achievement because it was based on different technologies, also to lead flutter, Azure as well as IoT team was best achievement for me.','I like good working environment and opportunities to work on different platform and technologies, appreciation from leadership of organization, also like the opportunity to discuss with client on live project.','No issue.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(221,244,134,208,'2023-06-01','completed','Good , Because I am working on successfully live project.\r\n','I learned to independent confidently build any type of attractive mobile application, iOS application, web application and website in Flutter UI and as well as Api Integration with flutter end like Data Post and Get from API.\r\n\r\nMake the Android Build release and upload on play store, Make the IOs Build for I-phone device','Like : Our team leader before assigning each task better lead and we are stuck in a project then resolve the problem.\r\n\r\nDislike : NA','No',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
