(223,269,134,0,'2023-11-01','completed','This year has been productive for me. I had the opportunity to work on real projects, which allowed me to showcase my skills. I was able to identify and report bugs in the application, and worked closely with the development team to resolve them. This collaborative effort not only improved the quality of our product, but also enhanced my understanding of the software development lifecycle. I look forward to continuing to contribute to our teamâ€™s success in the coming year.','This year, I worked on a live project and interacted with clients, enhancing my technical, communication and client management skills. Iâ€™m proud of these achievements and look forward to future opportunities.','I like how our company always tries new things and helps us learn. But, I wish we could have more time for our personal life. Maybe we could work from home sometimes or choose our work hours.','no',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(224,250,81,212,'2023-11-01','pending_at_hr','The past year has been satisfactory for me. I have made significant progress on a key project, including the development of a new firmware algorithm that has improved the performance of our product. I have also created a satisfactory data transfer to the cloud through Bluetooth. Created libraries for memory management in the Flash device and more. \r\n\r\nI learned new technologies and wireless protocols','-Satisfying client needs: I have worked closely with clients to understand their needs and develop firmware solutions that meet their requirements. This has resulted in a high level of customer satisfaction.\r\n\r\n-Providing presentations to clients over PPT and Docs: I have also provided presentations to clients over PPT and Docs to communicate the technical details of our products and to answer their questions efficiently. \r\n\r\n-Creating memory management libraries in flash memory: I have developed a set of memory management libraries that are optimized for flash memory. This has improved the performance and reliability of our products.\r\n\r\n-Adding complete Bluetooth pairing, data transfer, and exception handling code: I have implemented complete Bluetooth pairing, data transfer, and exception handling code. This has enabled our products to communicate wirelessly with other devices in a reliable and secure manner.\r\n\r\n-Creating a library for emergency beacon situations and reading memory and live data at the emergency situation: I have developed a library that can be used to create emergency beacon situations and read memory and live data during emergency situations. This library has been used to prevent the loss of data when the development board will burn out.\r\n\r\n-Resolving memory leaks, sensors data optimization, and the old but stubborn problem of getting the Air quality index sensor data by adding the major change in the libraries of sensor: I have resolved a number of challenging technical issues, including memory leaks, sensor data optimization, and the problem of getting the Air quality index sensor data. These resolutions have improved the performance, reliability, and accuracy of our products.','I like working for this organization because of the positive and supportive company culture. I feel valued and respected by my manager and colleagues. I also appreciate the opportunities for professional development and growth that the company offers.\n\nOne thing that I dislike about working for this organization is the lack of opportunities for advancement. I have been working on the same project for a very long time and I feel like I am ready for a new challenge.','I would like to express my concern regarding the salary deduction policy that was applied to me due to the absence of a client project. While I understand the company\'s need to adjust compensation based on project availability, I believe that the deduction of 33.33% is excessive.\r\nThe lack of client project assignments has not only impacted my financial situation but also hindered my professional growth. This deduction in my monthly income,  impacted my financial situation and has caused significant financial strain., also  impacted my ability to develop my skills and gain valuable experience.\r\nI would like to request a review of the current deduction policy and propose a more personalized approach that considers my individual circumstances. I request that the company consider a more lenient policy for me. For example, the company could consider a smaller deduction, such as 3-4%, or no deduction at all. A reduced/no deduction would alleviate the financial burden and allow me to focus on my professional development and maintain my financial stability, ultimately benefiting both myself and the company.\r\nI am confident that we can find a mutually agreeable solution that addresses my concerns while aligning with the company\'s overall objectives. Thank you for your consideration.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:17:18','2025-08-22 09:17:18'),
(225,252,81,213,'2023-12-01','completed','The past year has been satisfactory for me. I have made significant progress on a key project, including the use of a new cloud platform Linode  that has improved the performance of our product and reduce our overall cost of cloud . I have also created a satisfactory data transfer route to dashboard using rule chain .Created custom widget for the dashboard acc to the design and much  more. ','-Satisfying client needs: I have worked closely with clients to understand their needs and develop dashboard solutions that meet their requirements. This has resulted in a high level of customer satisfaction.\r\n-Providing presentations to clients over PPT and Docs: I have also provided presentations to clients over PPT and Docs to communicate the technical details of our products and to answer their questions efficiently. \r\n-Shifting to cloud product : i have on shifting out current solution from aws to Linode without any big down time  This has resulted in a high level of customer satisfaction.\r\n-Worked on data transfer speed:i have worked closely on telemetry data transfer speed to reducing its speed significantly,This has resulted in a high level of customer satisfaction.\r\n-Creating custom alarms : i have worked closely on creating custom alarms which can be used by client to get real time data \r\n','I enjoy working here because of the positive and supportive company culture. I feel valued and respected by my manager and colleagues. The opportunities for professional growth are also something I truly appreciate.\r\n\r\nOne thing that I dislike about working for this organization is the lack of opportunities for advancement. I have been working on the same project for a very long time and I feel like I am ready for a new challenge.\r\n\r\n','No issues ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
