(235,262,81,215,'2024-03-01','submitted_to_appraiser','past year has been good for me both personally and professionally. Worked on the cellcheck project, Improved my flutter skills by adding various features/functionality.','Over the past year, I have majorly worked on cellcheck and status app. my most important achievements are  * working on the FOTA (firmware over the air) task on cellcheck. * working on the resolving the issue of FOTA update on iOS device. * adding WebView in the android and iOS application to show thingsboard Dashboard by understanding the logic behind the thingsboard sample app. * working with client directly and done modification accordingly.  * working on the status app and adding push notification using firebase. * recreating home page for the status web to resolve various issues. * creating windows and macos application of status using flutter project (including creating a custom flutter package to select download path in macos).','I appreciate the positive work culture and supportive atmosphere within the organization. Colleagues are collaborative, and 	heres a strong sense of teamwork, which fosters creativity and innovation.','No Issues.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-22 09:17:18','2025-08-22 09:17:18'),
(237,134,83,217,'2024-03-01','completed','This year has been productive for me. I am looking forward to continuing\nto contribute to our team’s success in the coming year.','This year i worked on new technologies projects and also very much confident to work on new technologies independently . I also experienced that very rarely found the issues in my soruce code once i finished the tasks .','I like everything about organization except leave related issues .','No Issue',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(239,221,81,216,'2024-03-01','submitted_to_appraiser','It was good , because I have worked on GFOOD project and also learned new technologies such as python, AI, LLM.  Created a Chatbot in python for any pdf, doc or URL','Worked in backend and frontend (nodejs and flutter) simultaneously. Also worked in marketing team of Gfood and supported  company in their business development team.','Likes:->Supportive Seniors, Healthy ambience of the organisations. Dislikes:-> Lack of advance availability of new client projects and poor chairs conditions.','Yes, Inhouse Projects should be an alternative , if their are no client projects in hand. Company should focus on selling  products to others',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-22 09:17:18','2025-08-22 09:17:18'),
(240,81,83,220,'2024-05-01','completed','Last year was a mix of good and bad experiences. During certain months, I collaborated with clients, successfully delivered projects, and gained extensive knowledge, particularly in utilizing Azure services, executing backup tasks, and sharing insights with the team.However, there were also challenging times when productivity was low, making it tough to maintain job satisfaction. Despite this, I empathized with the company\'s situation and actively sought new opportunities.','The most important achievement was training a new team of 6 members, creating a proper target sheet, administering technical tests, and providing training in various technologies.','I thoroughly enjoy the positive working environment fostered by the company, which encourages collaboration and innovation. Additionally, the multitude of new opportunities offered by the company allows for personal and professional growth, making it an exciting place to be.','no issue',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(241,307,81,0,'2024-08-01','completed','My past time in this organisation is good and I have learned alot in my training period and also perform very well according to every task given to me.','I have build a 3d model in unity and integrated it with flutter where both are very new technology to me. and i had done it successfully id the most important achievement of the past for me.','I like the work culture and also friendly environment of this organisation. regarding work and culture there is nothing to dislike. ','Nothing that i can address.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(242,310,81,0,'2024-08-01','completed','Reflecting on the past year, it has been satisfactory and a tremendous learning experience. Starting as a fresher with limited knowledge, I have worked on various tasks over the last six months, significantly expanding my understanding.','Learning and Working with Flutter Designed UI for various pages of the SOS project.\r\nWork on Bloc Pattern Improved state management skills in Flutter applications.\r\nLearn about Node.js and API Integration Expanded backend development capabilities.\r\nLearn about PHP  Enhanced ability to work on full-stack projects.\r\nExploring WordPress  Broadened understanding of content management systems and website development','I really like the supportive environment here, especially from seniors like Manoj Sir, who was also my trainer. His patience and clarity in explanations, regardless of how many questions you ask, are remarkable. Additionally, the punctuality in salary payments is highly commendable, reflecting our boss efficiency and ensuring smooth operations. However, one thing I do not particularly like is the lack of coffee. I do wish we had coffee available, as it would be great to have a caffeine fix during long hours.','No',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(245,312,81,0,'2024-08-01','completed','The past year is satisfactory for me in this organisation. I have successfully completed my goals, learned new skills, and contributed to my team. I have take new challenges and responsibilities, which helped me grow professionally. I am happy with my progress and want to continuing to improve and contribute more in the future.','1. Successfully contributed to the Floor Plan module of the SOS project, developing a comprehensive and functional layout using Flutter.\n2. Applied BLoC state management in the Floor Plan module to enhance the modules performance and maintainability.\n3.Completed training in Python and Machine Learning, positioning myself to contribute effectively to future projects involving these technologies.\n4.Having advanced knowledge of data structures to improve problem-solving capabilities, which has significantly benefited my work.','I enjoyed working on challenging project that make my skills strong and help me in grow, I have get the opportunity for professional development in this organisation, such as the training which is received in python and Machine Learning.','No',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(246,311,81,0,'2024-08-01','pending_at_hr','The past year is satisfactory for me because I have learned new skills, and contribute to the live project with the team. I learned new technologies during my training period like, Javascript, wordpress, php, laravel, api integration and flutter and use these technologies in the project or tasks which is given to me. ','1.Worked on live project of sense of space and work on various module of it, develop the layout using flutter and it work properly,\n2.Implement the Bloc state management to the project(SOS) in profile and dasboard module for the performance increase of the module.\n3.Having knowledge of Wordpress and php which will help me in working on future project to the related technologies.','I like the senior who support me in my work and explain all the details of project, so the project make easy to work on. I learn various new skills in my training period and grow professionally with this organisation.','Nothing',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-22 09:17:18','2025-08-22 09:17:18'),
(247,313,134,0,'2024-08-01','completed','My  past year is good for me because I learned new technologies during my training period and given opportunity for implement these technologies on project with the team','my past year  achievements was addressing and resolving a challenging issue related to the display of distance floating text show  on the UI. and removed the plane scan property  make it working without plan detection using 3D unity. and use dhiwise Ai to check the api integration.','I like the senior who support me in my work and explain all the details of regarding my project and problem. I learn various new skills in my training period and grow professionally with this organisation.','No',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(248,304,83,0,'2024-08-01','completed','My experience was good working at Key Software Services, as i got to learn new things related to my role and other professional Etiquette.','I became confident by having conversation with the leads and client and become able to manage project and that is my biggest achievement.','Thing that i like is work life balance, and did not see any thing that is to be disliked yet.','No.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(249,325,83,0,'2024-12-01','pending_at_hr','Over the past few months, my experience in this role has been highly\r positive. As this is my first job, I have acquired valuable insights and\r skills that have played a crucial role in my professional development. I\r am thankful for the opportunities I ve had to learn and grow, and I am\r eager to continue making meaningful contributions to the team while\r further refining my abilities.','Over the past few months, I have experienced a significant boost in my\r confidence, allowing me to embrace new challenges with enthusiasm\r and a positive mindset. Furthermore, I have enhanced my practical skills\r in accounting, which has greatly improved my overall performance in my\r role.','During my time in this organization, I have found no dislikes, instead, I\r am truly appreciative of the many positive elements that enhance my\r experience here. I value the supportive colleagues who create a\r collaborative atmosphere and the friendly environment that makes each\r day enjoyable. Additionally, the approachable and encouraging nature of\r my seniors has been instrumental in my professional growth.',' I would like to express that I do not have any issues within my role or the\r organization.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-22 09:17:18','2025-08-22 09:17:18'),
(250,331,83,0,'2025-02-01','completed','\r\nThe past year has been a great learning experience for me. Iâ€™ve gained valuable skills such as creating strategies to promote services on social media, developing social media calendars, and mastering WordPress. Additionally, Iâ€™ve learned SEO, PPC, META Ads, and Google Analytics. Iâ€™ve also researched various companies to understand how they promote their services. All of this has greatly contributed to my growth and success in my work.\r\n','This past year has been an incredible learning journey for me as a digital marketer! Iâ€™ve worked on growing LinkedIn followers for KeySS Inc and Key Software Services, and Iâ€™m proud to have achieved 25k+ views. Every day, I create and share posts across different platforms, write blogs for our website with SEO in mind, and design creative ad templates using Canva. Iâ€™ve also learned how to analyze competitors, understand what works, and create meaningful content, and i love to work here,','I truly love being part of this team. Every task feels like an opportunity to learn and grow, and Iâ€™m always eager to find solutions, no matter the challenge. The people here are wonderfulâ€”kind, supportive, and inspiring to work with. Thereâ€™s honestly nothing Iâ€™d dislike about this experience.','I don\'t have any issue ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'I would appreciate if you could learn whatever you have mentioned in your goals. All the best.',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(251,330,83,0,'2025-02-01','completed','The past year at KeySS has been incredibly rewarding. Iâ€™ve gained valuable skills in interacting with people politely and professionally, both internally and externally. This being my first stable job, Iâ€™ve significantly improved my discipline and time management, learning to execute tasks with precision and efficiency. Additionally, Iâ€™ve developed better communication with colleagues and seniors, which has positively impacted my professional and personal growth. Working at KeySS has been a tremendous learning experience, shaping me into a more confident and capable professional.\r\n','\r\nOver the past year, I have significantly improved my communication skills and developed the ability to handle complex tasks with patience. Iâ€™ve gained experience conducting meetings, engaging with clients, and building connections. Additionally, I successfully acquired free leads on Bark without any investment, showcasing resourcefulness and initiative. These experiences have strengthened my professional capabilities.\r\n','KeySS offers a healthy work environment with excellent communication and mutual respect among all levels, including the CEO, who is approachable and professional. The open hierarchy fosters collaboration and respects employees\' personal lives, creating a positive workspace.\r\n\r\nHowever, as a business developer, Iâ€™ve observed a strong focus on connecting with large brands while smaller enterprises are sometimes overlooked. Additionally, occasional lapses in coordination have led to missed opportunities. These areas, if addressed, could further enhance KeySSâ€™s growth and employee experience.\r\n','Currently, there are no major issues.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'I hope you have achieved everything that you mentioned in your goals.',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(252,134,83,237,'2025-03-01','completed','It was good because what i had done the bug free technical tasks / projects And also complete the each tasks on time as per provided the quote for each tasks.\r\n','There are more than 2-3 projects which I had completed successfully last year . And clients are very happy for those projects .And i am ready to work any type of technical task which should be bug free for the clients . i have now exposure in some new technologies like Flutter , NodeJs , etc which is the achievement for me  \r\n','I like everything about organization except leave rules. \r\n','No Issue',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(253,333,83,0,'2025-04-01','completed','The past year has been satisfactory for me. I have learned many new things and acquired new skills, while also taking on many challenges and responsibilities that have helped me grow professionally.','I recruited the freshers for various profiles, including conducting campus recruitment drives. Additionally, I organize fun activities on the last Friday of every month to boost employee engagement. I also handle performance appraisals and ensure that employee records and documents are accurately maintained and regularly updated. I also resolve the issues of the employees and manage the joining and exit formalities of the employees.','I really appreciate the work culture of the company, and there is nothing that I dislike.','No.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(254,334,83,0,'2025-05-01','completed','Over the past few months, my experience in this role has been highly positive. As this is my first job, I have gained valuable insights and skills that have significantly contributed to my professional development. I am truly grateful for the opportunities I have had to learn and grow, and I am eager to continue making meaningful contributions to the team while further refining my abilities.','In recent months, I have noticed a considerable increase in my confidence, which has helped me take on new challenges with a motivated and optimistic attitude. In addition, I have strengthened my hands-on accounting skills, leading to a noticeable improvement in my performance and efficiency at work.','My time in this organization has been really good. I enjoy working in a friendly place where everyone helps each other and works well as a team. My coworkers are supportive, which makes every day enjoyable. My seniors are kind and always encourage me, and their guidance has helped me learn and grow a lot.','I do not have any other issues.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'I would Appreciate if you could learn whatever you have mentioned in your goals.All the best.',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(257,338,83,0,'2025-05-01','completed','satisfactory as the staff is good and my colleague are very supportive','Most important achievement i got is how to interact with people and learned professional etiquettes. Technical things also i learned while 2 months of training.','What i like about the company is that both the team and boss are very chill in nature , Very helpful to me . Nature is kind hearted and no pressure where i can work easily to give my full potential.','Not such issues but my laptop hangs sometime i am in kinda get rid of this issue',NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'2025-08-22 09:12:23','2025-08-22 09:12:23'),
(258,313,134,247,'2025-08-01','pending_at_hr','my past year has been a good and  valuable learning experience for me. I had the opportunity to work on  projects that helped me strengthen my skills in  Flutter development and  as well as explore manual  testing.','One of my most important achievements this year was successfully working on the SOS project and contributing to its quality and functionality. I also had the opportunity to explore and work with Unity software, and I successfully integrated Unity with the SOS project to enhance its features. This helped me improve my technical skills, learn new tools, and contribute to delivering a better user experience for the project.','I like really appreciate the collaborative work culture and the opportunities I get to learn new skills and technologies and I currently don’t have any dislikes about the organization. I value the opportunities, team support, and the work environment that helps me grow and perform better.','No','2025-08-28 05:16:03','2025-08-28 05:27:04',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-08-22 09:17:18','2025-08-28 05:46:53'),
(259,304,83,248,'2025-08-01','completed','My experience in past was good as the working environment is very good, friendly cooperative colleagues.','I got chance to work as on various roles as a BDE that is: client management, lead generation.','Nothing as such to dislike','No','2025-09-26 10:39:43','2025-09-26 16:17:13','2025-10-08 12:11:51','I hope you have achieved the targets you mentioned in it.\n','<h4>Mentioned Skills & Themes</h4><p>Lead, Communication.</p><h4>Stated Areas for Development</h4><ul><li>My experience was good working at Key Software Services, as i got to learn new things related to my role and other professional Etiquette</li><li>Will improve my performance and communication skills</li></ul>','2025-08-22 09:17:18','2025-10-08 12:11:51'),
(260,339,134,NULL,'2025-10-01','submitted_to_appraiser','Good. The past year has been a period of significant growth and learning for me. I\'ve\n gained extensive knowledge and hands-on experience in various technologies and\n platforms, including OOP concepts (data hiding, encapsulation, abstraction, inheritance,\n polymorphism, threading, exception handling), web technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript,\n jQuery, Ajax, PHP, MySQL), Flutter development (Dart, widgets, state management like\n Provider and Riverpod, API integration, local database handling), Node.js development\n (Express.js, API creation, authentication, Firebase integration), and GitHub for version\n control. This diverse exposure has greatly enhanced my technical skills and confidence.','My most important achievement has been the comprehensive learning and practical\n application across multiple technology stacks. Specifically, from March to May, I diligently\n completed intensive training modules in object-oriented programming, web development,\n and Flutter. This was immediately followed by active contributions to the \"Status App\"\n project from May to August, where I debugged critical issues, implemented new features\n like Check-In/Check-Out, Performance Review enhancements (including UI/UX\n improvements, API integrations for appraisal flows, and permission management), and set\n up robust backend infrastructure. Successfully navigating and contributing to a live project\n while continuously expanding my technical repertoire stands out as a significant\n accomplishment.','I greatly appreciate the organization\'s commitment to fostering a learning-rich and\n challenging environment. The opportunity to work on diverse projects and technologies\n has been invaluable for my career and personal development. The collaborative\n atmosphere, especially during debugging sessions and knowledge sharing, is something I\n particularly value. I don\'t have any specific dislikes, as I view every challenge as an\n opportunity to learn and grow.','I am eager to continue expanding my responsibilities and contributing to more complex\n projects. I am particularly interested in deeper involvement in system architecture and\n optimization, further enhancing my problem-solving skills, and taking on initiatives that\n drive innovation within the team.','2025-10-29 01:55:42',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-01 09:48:09','2025-10-29 01:55:42'),
(261,338,83,257,'2025-09-01','completed','It was an good lesson for and teached me alot of new things which helped me to grow in my carrier.','Gained experience in approaching and engaging new prospects on LinkedIn.\n\nLearned and effectively utilized CRM tools to manage leads and track outreach.\n\nExplored new platforms and strategies for business development and lead generation.\n\nExpanded knowledge in both technical and marketing aspects, enhancing overall B2B outreach effectiveness.','What I appreciate most about the company is the supportive and helpful environment. The guidance from management, along with collaboration with my colleagues, has allowed me to learn a lot and take on more responsibilities, helping me grow professionally.','N/A','2025-09-25 11:29:37','2025-09-26 16:34:16','2026-02-09 09:42:03','I hope you were able to achieve all your assigned targets.','<h4>Mentioned Skills & Themes</h4><p>Lead, Support.</p><h4>Stated Areas for Development</h4><ul><li>Technical things also i learned while 2 months of training</li><li>Most important achievement i got is how to interact with people and learned professional etiquettes</li></ul>','2025-09-18 11:14:16','2026-02-09 09:42:03');
